  <name>CheckCCDNumberFillingWhilePurchasingGoodsFromVendorUsingGoodsInTransitScheme</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Check CCD number filling while purchasing goods from vendor using &quot;goods in transit&quot; scheme</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>بررسی تکمیل شماره CCD هنگام خرید کالا از تأمین‌کننده با طرح &quot;کالاهای در راه&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Verificare la compilazione dei numeri della polizza di carico doganale all'acquisto dal fornitore secondo lo schema &quot;merci in corso&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Sprawdź wypełnienie numerów TDC przy zakupie u dostawcy według schematu &quot;wiersze pozycji w drodze&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Проверять заполнение номеров ГТД при закупке у поставщика по схеме &quot;товары в пути&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Tedarikçiden satın alırken GKB numaralarının bakiyelerini &quot;transit mallar&quot; şemasına göre kontrol et</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Kiểm tra việc điền số tờ khai hải quan khi mua hàng của nhà cung cấp theo sơ đồ &quot;hàng đi đường&quot;</value>
  </synonym>
